cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research corpus, please cite this repository release and the relevant upstream dataset publications."
title: "Corpus of Hate Speech from Ten Datasets: Historical MSc Corpus and Audited Research Workflow"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Wiczewa
    given-names: Monika
repository-code: "https://github.com/monikawiczewa/hate-speech-corpus"
url: "https://github.com/monikawiczewa/hate-speech-corpus"
abstract: >-
  Complete research repository for a corpus integrating ten existing hate-speech
  and related subjective-language datasets, developed for a University of
  Sheffield MSc dissertation in 2025. Includes original source files, cleaned
  and tokenized corpora, notebooks, historical splits, and a separately audited
  2026 group-aware splitting and verification workflow. The corrected pipeline
  verifies 257576 usable cleaned records and prevents normalized-exact sentence
  groups from crossing partitions; no new model-performance result is claimed.
keywords:
  - hate speech
  - natural language processing
  - subjectivity
  - dataset integration
  - corpus
  - reproducibility
